<title>USA: Global Directmail Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Global Directmail Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PORT WASHINGTON, N.Y. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global DirectMail Corp</p>
<p>			     Statement of Income (A)</p>
<p>		    (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				     Quarter Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				  9/30/96   9/30/95  9/30/96  9/30/95</p>
<p> Net sales		    $225,868 $152,949 $658,307 $463,077</p>
<p>  Net income		     10,683    7,940   31,862   23,834</p>
<p> Net income per common share  0.28     0.22     0.84     0.68</p>
<p>Number of common and common</p>
<p>equivalent shares outstanding</p>
<p>				    38,378   36,874   38,068   34,863</p>
<p> Earnings per share for the					0.65</p>
<p>nine months ended September 30, 1995 assuming 36.7 million shares of common stock outstanding after the Company's June 1995 Initial Public Offering.</p>
<p>(A)  Presentation for the nine months ended September 30, 1995 includes pro forma adjustments to show the predecessor companies as if they were a public company.</p>
